# Trusted prebuilt ArtCraft CLIs: the SHA-256 of every <pkg>.gz that install.sh may install from the `bin` branch.
# install.sh refuses a prebuilt whose checksum is not listed here (checked before it is decompressed or run), and
# .github/workflows/publish-bin.yml publishes to `bin` only the release candidate whose files match this list exactly.
#
# Change it only by pull request: copy the `bin.sha256` artifact of a green "Build ArtCraft CLIs" run on main
# (it names the run below), review it, merge. Merging publishes those exact binaries (docs/install.md, "Releases").
